WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:11.390
70% of the silent movies made in America have
been lost.

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:16.680
The average human body contains 0.2mg of gold.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:24.960
Until the 1940s, fake snow in movies was made
by painting cornfakes white.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:31.099
If you drink one glass of water for every
alcoholic beverage, it significantly reduces

00:00:31.099 --> 00:00:33.830
your chance of getting a hangover.

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:39.450
Usain Bolt ate 1,000 chicken nuggets during
the Beijing Olympics because he didn't like

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.550
Chinese food.

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:46.040
Sheep can see behind themselves without moving
their heads.

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:51.220
There are more libraries in Britain's prisons
than there are in its schools.

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:55.970
If you hold your breath and put your face
in cold water, your heart will immediately

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:59.210
slow down by 25%.

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:03.350
A person usually makes a lot of hand gestures
when telling the truth.

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:07.740
When telling a lie however, a person's hands
tend to stay still.

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:14.570
1 in 5 kidneys donated in the US are thrown
away because a suitable recipient can't be

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:16.240
found.

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:23.430
People spend 47% of their waking hours thinking
about something other than what they're doing.

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:31.100
Anthropologists believe that man has known
how to use fire for 500,000 years, but only

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:35.979
learned how to make it himself 12,000 years
ago.

00:01:35.979 --> 00:01:42.429
A peppier is a waiter whose sole job is to
go round with a pepper grinder.

00:01:42.429 --> 00:01:48.380
A “moment” is actually a medieval unit
of time that means 90 seconds.

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:55.929
At Stalin's funeral 500 people were trampled
to death.

00:01:55.929 --> 00:02:07.810
The force required to pull one leg from quicksand
is the same needed to lift a small car.

